OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADad of drowned teen says death
OL,4,Astill 'not clear'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe father of a 15-year-old boy who
OL,7,Fdrowned in a flooded Kent quarry during
OL,8,Fa summer heatwave says it is still "not
OL,9,Fclear" what happened to his son, an
OL,10,Finquest has heard.
OL,12,FGeorge Cuckoo, from Gravesend, had gone
OL,13,Fswimming with a pair of friends in hot
OL,14,Fweather when he got into difficulty in
OL,15,Fthe middle of a 65m-long (213ft) muddy
OL,16,Flake in Swanscombe on 27 May.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
PN,32102
SC,0002
