OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1790607368
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADad of drowned teen says death
OL,4,Astill 'not clear'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis father, Simon Cuckoo, told the
OL,7,Fhearing in Maidstone that there had
OL,8,Fbeen differing reports on the
OL,9,Fteenager's final moments from the
OL,10,Fpolice and ambulance service, while
OL,11,Fformal statements were never taken from
OL,12,Fthe other two boys present.
OL,14,FHe says he also knows children are
OL,15,Fstill "going in the lake" even after
OL,16,Fhis son's death.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
